    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 The pet of the brilliant mystic, Sartune of Elmoreden, who was imprisoned due to the jealousy and envy of his rivals. It lives up to Sartune's reputation, and is tremendously smart and playful to the point of cruelty. It causes havoc throughout the back roads through its many minions. Beast Lv. 3 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Beasts. Critical Damage +7.5% Atk. Spd. +5% Speed +5 Resistance to Derangement +20% Resistance to Sword +10% Resistance to Dual Sword +10% Resistance to Bleed -10% Resistance to Dagger -10% Resistance to Dual Dagger -10% Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
